      en: ["Manpo sits on the Yalu River, directly bordering Linjiang in Jilin Province, China.", "The Manpo-Linjiang railway bridge was constructed in 1939 during the colonial era.", "The settlement was officially designated as a city (Si) in 1967.", "Logging and timber processing are the most prominent industries in the region.", "It serves as the northern terminus of the Manpo Line railway from Pyongyang.", "The city is home to the Manpo Machinery Factory, which produces heavy equipment."],
      es: ["Ciudad fronteriza con Ji'an, China.", "Importante paso ferroviario y de carretera hacia China.", "Centro de la industria del procesamiento de madera.", "Ubicada en la montañosa provincia de Chagang.", "Lugar importante para la producción de armamento.", "El puente de Yalu fue destruido en la Guerra de Corea y reconstruido."],
      pt: ["Cidade fronteiriça com Ji'an, China.", "Importante cruzamento ferroviário e rodoviário para a China.", "Centro da indústria de processamento de madeira.", "Localizada na província montanhosa de Chagang.", "Local importante para a produção de armamento.", "A ponte Yalu foi destruída na Guerra da Coreia e reconstruída."],
      fr: ["Ville frontalière de Ji'an, en Chine.", "Important passage ferroviaire et routier vers la Chine.", "Centre de l'industrie de transformation du bois.", "Située dans la province montagneuse de Chagang.", "Site important pour la production d'armement.", "Le pont du Yalu a été détruit pendant la guerre de Corée puis reconstruit."],
